+## Duplicate evaluation
+
+`GameRule.duplicate` defaults to `False` for both presets. When enabled,
+four-player games use fixed per-seat draws and scheduled dealer progression.
+See [DUPLICATE.md](DUPLICATE.md) for the full wall, kan, exhaustion, and match
+contract.
